*modified 2/20/91 eb - added fee field to file
*modified 12/2/91 eb - added agross field to file
MAS 10000
LIST X99999 KEY1 ACCT#
DATE DT ASC2
TIME A8 ASC3
TYPE A1 ASC4 ATYPE
AMT1 D2 - PAMT1 AAMT1 RAMT1
INT1 D2 - PINT1 RINT1
AMT2 D2 - PAMT2 AAMT2 RAMT2
INT2 D2 - PINT2 RINT2
LIEN D2 - PLIEN ALIEN RLIEN
FEES D2 - PFEES AFEES RFEES
DESC A24 - PDESC ADESC RDESC
CERT# I
SEQ I
AGROSS D
BATCH X9999
YR X9999          "LIST YEAR"
SELECT LIST NE 0 AND TYPE NE 'Z'
